        "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Volunteer.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Wear a tuxedo.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>And yes, Rabit, her name was Ariel, you remembered correctly.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/+1.png?v=9\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\"></p>\n<p>I'll try and start uploading all of the cosplay photos I have soon.</p>",
